	(text "For the piezo driver channels, the load\n(28k resistor) sits on a different board.\nConnect OUT, SENSEP, and SENSEN electrically\ncloser to the target load resistor. Thus,\nSENSEN will use the ground potential at the\ntarget destination instead of the main board."
